flowchart TD
    A[User Preferences\ngenre, mood, energy] --> B[Load Songs from CSV]
    B --> C[Loop Through Every Song]
    C --> D{Genre Match?}
    D -- Yes --> E[+2.0 points]
    D -- No --> F[+0 points]
    E --> G{Mood Match?}
    F --> G
    G -- Yes --> H[+1.0 point]
    G -- No --> I[+0 points]
    H --> J[Calculate Energy Similarity\n1.0 - abs difference]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Add Energy Score\nup to +1.0]
    K --> L[Store Final Score + Reasons]
    L --> C
    L --> M[Sort All Songs by Score\nHighest to Lowest]
    M --> N[Return Top K Recommendations\nwith Explanations]
